we all right  i don't want to ruin my makeup  you might think you know everything  there is to know about kim kardashian  but the reality star spilled the  freaking tea with david letterman  on netflix's my next guest needs no  introduction  i'm so happy that it's been well  received now we are breaking down the  eight things we learned from her tell  all interview starting with this the o.j  simpson trial tore her family apart and  put kim and her sister courtney  in an awkward position the week before  that happened we were all in mexico  together and at a family  trip the simpsons and us chris was best  friends with oj's late wife  nicole brown simpson and took a firm  stand against the former athlete  my mom was extremely vocal on her  feelings  what did she think you know she was  believed that  you know her friend was murdered by him  and that was really traumatizing for her  and then we'd go to my dad's house and  it was a whole other situation there and  it would be like johnny cochran bob  shapiro  my dad like the whole team so we didn't  really know what to believe or whose  side to take as kids  because we didn't want to hurt one of  our parents feelings  kim says the tension only got worse as  the trial continued  my dad took us to court one day with him  and he took us out of school and didn't  tell my mom  and i remember my mom was sitting with  nicole's parents and  courtney and i were sitting right behind  o.j  and we like look over at my mom and  she's like giving us this death stare  like what are you doing out of school  what are you doing here  and courtney and i were like just look  straight do not look at mom  it kind of tore our family apart i'd say  for the whole time of the trial and  speaking of awkward number seven on our  list kim was once mistakenly mislabeled  as  a mistress arriving at her dad's house  yup kim recalls after oj was deemed  not guilty in court robert told a then  14 year old kim and her sister courtney  to come to the house where the legal  team was celebrating  well the two drove over illegally and  were snapped entering the house  i pulled up to the gate on my way home  and there was all these cameras outside  and then that night on hard copy  it said robert kardashian's mistress  pulling up to his house  and i was like oh my god like i couldn't  believe it  that they were making this stuff up and  that was like my first real lesson with  the media  moving right along to number six kim's  following in her late dad's footsteps  studying law and when it comes to her  non-traditional law program  the 40 year old is in good company  abraham lincoln did it this way  famously so it's it's legit the kkw  founder assured people that her at home  program through the california state bar  is just as hard as the more traditional  law school route  and get ready for the cutest thing  you'll hear all day  kim's hubby kanye west helps their  daughter north with her school  dance competitions we just took our  daughter to a  a school dance and there's a dance  competition  and you know how will she feel if she  wins how she feels she doesn't win  and it consumes you so how did she do at  the dance competition  her and kanye have won i think the last  two years in a row  she definitely has kanye's outgoing  personality  and will say whatever is on her mind  no matter what it is or who it might  offend  and get this none of us have spoken  and we're letting bruce speak first  before caitlyn jenner fully transitioned  kim recalls being 26 years old and  walking in on her then step dad bruce  dressed as a woman bruce called my phone  and said whenever you're ready i'd love  to sit you down and talk to you  but in the meantime don't tell a soul  your mom has no idea and she will kill  me  it was just a little confusing because  we all wanted to be there in support of  but then also wanting to support our mom  who this is news to  married to someone for 22 years her  heart is broken  and they have children and and it was  just a lot  when you kind of find out along with the  whole world  but my favorite moment of the whole  thing kim  admitting her little sisters kendall and  kylie jenner  have no clue who david letterman is  yes i'm serious i hope hope hope  you don't take offense to this but i was  telling kendall and kylie i was like  oh i'm gonna go do letterman and they  were like who what  like like like they  literally only do social media stuff  and that to me was like what it was so  fascinating  number two on our list kim revealed that  back in october 2016  on the same day she was robbed at  gunpoint in paris  she had a conversation earlier that day  about a potential robbery scenario  me and my girlfriends we had lunch that  day  and said if you guys were robbed what  would you do would you just give them  the stuff  why we had this conversation it was so  wild and i said i would say  take everything just take just take  everything nothing is important  and last but not least kim  thinks her man makes more money than her  keyword being  thinks who's making more money  him probably probably probably how close  are we  we're exactly even  [Laughter]  well good we both are really blessed and  do extremely well  and i'm really grateful

